{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgubx5i428oC2a1MRBiSC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the route to `route.camel.yaml`. I haven't run it or validated it against a Camel 4.22 runtime.\n\n- **Input:** it receives orders on `direct:accepted`.\n- **Record key:** it copies the `orderId` header into the `kafka.KEY` header, and the Kafka producer uses that as the record key. The endpoint's `key` option only takes a fixed value, so it can't read a different key from each message.\n- **Kafka producer:** it sends to the topic `orders.accepted` with these settings:\n  - `brokers: \"{{kafka.brokers}}\"` reads the broker list from the `kafka.brokers` property.\n  - `enableIdempotence: true` makes the producer idempotent.\n  - `requestRequiredAcks: all` waits for all in-sync replicas to acknowledge.\n  - `compressionCodec: lz4` sets the compression.\n\nIdempotence also needs retries above 0 and no more than 5 in-flight requests per connection. The component's defaults already meet both, so I didn't set them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":782,"cache_read_input_tokens":4563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":782},"output_tokens":346,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5816fd64-e167-4d4d-b683-6343d89f43d7","uuid":"a6ab0ba0-efbc-43dc-9c02-03ce3cce0448","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:59:10.666Z","request_id":"req_011Cgubx5Uuccn8ZEQD2Bp8v"}
